{
	"name": "Voice of Authority",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/creatures/abilities/mouth-teeth-human.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 12th level, your ability to subtly, or not so subtly, manipulate people’s perception of you grows. When using the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.5o1rvwzxmsh5ji9i]{Druidcraft}, @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.w8n4gqw7ugbcfqhh]{Glamour}, @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.uy8he1yquaiym6y8]{Prestidigitation}, or @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.eiek2vbzwijd0qac]{Thaumaturgy} cantrips to garner attention or increase your presence, you may give yourself advantage on a single Deception, Intimidation, or Persuasion check made during the duration. You may use this ability once per short or long rest.</p><p>In addition, choose one of the above listed cantrips to add to your repertoire. If you possess all of the above options, you may instead use this ability twice per short or long rest.</p>",
